Open Standard License — STIC Reference Implementation

STIC — Structural Integrity without Cloud (Correctness Without Cloud Dependency)
Shunyaya Structural Infrastructure Model

Legal Status

This license is a permissive Open Standard license for the STIC reference implementation.

To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, this license grants rights similar in spirit to permissive open-source licenses, while preserving truthful representation requirements for the STIC name and reference implementation.

If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect.

Nature of Release

This is a minimal, self-contained reference implementation.

It is intended to demonstrate a structural system correctness model — not to represent a full distributed system, cloud architecture, or infrastructure platform.

Behavioral guarantees apply only within the scope of the reference model and its defined structural assumptions.

